# Smaller groups with randomized separation and rejoining

Status: DONE PUBLIC
Milestone: M79 Smaller grouped cream with independent internal motion
Dependencies: 83_CURSOR_BACKGROUND_CONTACT.todo

## Purpose

The owner asks to reduce only the grouped blobs by1.5X(two-thirds of their
current dimensions), then adds that members should repel and attract randomly
so they visibly separate. Individual droplets, spawned blobs, cursor and trail
must not be resized or otherwise changed.
The later05:33clarification additionally halves only the largest background groups.
Relative to the currently live release, largest group pieces/joined geometry are
one-third size; other groups are two-thirds. The original large-group classification
stays stable after resizing.

