## Acceptance criteria

- Joined/canonical geometry and constituent piece radii are one-third of the
  previous release for largest groups and two-thirds for other groups. The span
  naturally changes during the new separation motion.
- Every group can visibly split and rejoin without teleporting or changing identities.
- Random cycles remain reproducible and stable through resize and explicit Pause.
- Largest group envelopes stay at the outer edges throughout separation.
- Individual droplets, click-spawns and cursor/trail remain unchanged.
- No original image, private study, palette, notebook or ordering change.

